<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Tube presence classification on INST-CXR-BENCH-TUBE-CLASS as a function of vision encoder pretraining with increasing samples sizes from INST-CXR-BENCH. Left: AUPRC averaged across 11 lines and tubes tasks. Right: AUPRC for the tube mediastinal drain (Prevalance 5.6%). Task with the highest improvement when pretrained with 3.5M samples.</figcaption>
</figure>
